## Command

```shell
biome check --write doctype-after-script.astro
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true,
    "formatter": { "enabled": true }
  },
  "linter": { "enabled": false },
  "assist": { "enabled": false }
}
```

## `doctype-after-script.astro`

```astro
---
const title = "Astro";
---

<script is:inline>
console.log("ready");
</script>
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<title>{title}</title>
	</head>
	<body></body>
</html>

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Checked 1 file in <TIME>. Fixed 1 file.
```
